comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-26T12:13:36.253Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-07-26: searched all statuses for GH-739, existing duplicate clusters, findDuplicateClusters CLI, and batch duplicate sweep. Closed pm-2i12ti supplies the batch primitive, pm-4ri6 covers create-time advice, and pm-jmld covers merge execution; none exposes the requested read workflow, so this is the canonical surface child."
  "2026-07-26T19:42:55.554Z","harness:codex","Evidence: shipped bounded all-status duplicate discovery through CLI, MCP action contracts, PmClient, and top-level SDK helpers. Results provide deterministic canonical IDs, compact similarity summaries, cluster limits/status/since filters, and safe close guidance. Completion/contracts snapshots and a real temporary-tracker integration test are included. Fresh installed CLI acceptance found one two-item cluster. Linked tests passed; full coverage and static gates are green."
  "2026-07-26T19:51:34.195Z","harness:codex","PR evidence: completed implementation is published in broad SDK delivery PR #753 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/753. Hosted checks and the exact-head AI review loop will be recorded after completion."
